, "model_switcher_deny": []}, "recipient": "all", "channel": null}, "conversation_id": "688f93a6-a128-8330-8f2c-203efebb66ed", "error": null}, "c": 4}   \n\ndata: {"type": "title_generation", "title": "Marines seal comparison", "conversation_id": "688f93a6-a128-8330-8f2c-203efebb66ed"}\n\nevent: delta\ndata: {"p": "/message/content/thoughts", "o": "append", "v": [{"summary": "", "content": ""}]}\n\ndata: {"type": "message_marker", "conversation_id": "688f93a6-a128-8330-8f2c-203efebb66ed", "message_id": "a7e474ed-4d0c-458e-8845-39f6208f6c42", "marker": "cot_token", "event": "first"}\n\nevent: delta\ndata: {"p": "/message/content/thoughts/0/summary", "v": "Clar"}       \n\nevent: delta\ndata: {"p": "", "o": "patch", "v": [{"p": "/message/content/thoughts/0/summary", "o": "append", "v": "ifying marine seal query"}, {"p": "/message/content/thoughts/0/content", "o": "append", "v": "The user"}]}      \n\nevent: delta\ndata: {"p": "/message/content/thoughts/0/content", "o": "append", "v": " query \\u201cmarines seal\\u201d could be asking about Navy SEALs, but that\\u2019s part of"}   \n\nevent: delta\ndata: {"v": " the US Navy, not the Marines (USMC). It might be blending terms. Alternatively,"}       \n\nevent: delta\ndata: {"v": " they could be asking about how marines \\"seal\\" something, like hermetically sealing"}  \n\nevent: delta\ndata: {"v": ", or maybe regarding the Marine Corps\' official emblem, the Eagle, Globe"}       \n\nevent: delta\ndata: {"v": ", and Anchor. They might want to see the USMC emblem. I\\u2019ll lean toward them requesting information on"}     \n\nevent: delta\ndata: {"v": " the Marine Corps Seal and look for the image of it"}    \n\nevent: delta\ndata: {"p": "", "o": "patch", "v": [{"p": "/message/content/thoughts/0/content", "o": "append", "v": "."}, {"p": "/message/status", "o": "replace", "v": "finished_successfully"}]}   \n\nevent: delta\ndata: {"v": [{"p": "/message/content/thoughts", "o": "append", "v": [{"summary": "", "content": ""}]}, {"p": "/message/status", "o": "replace", "v": "in_progress"}]} \n\nevent: delta\ndata: {"v": [{"p": "/message/content/thoughts/1/summary", "o": "append", "v": "Clarifying the query"}, {"p": "/message/content/thoughts/1/content", "o": "append", "v": "The user just typed \\u201cmarines seal,\\u201d which could be asking about either the official"}]}    \n\nevent: delta\ndata: {"p": "/message/content/thoughts/1/content", "o": "append", "v": " seal of the U.S. Marine Corps or Navy SE"}   \n\nevent: delta\ndata: {"v": "ALs. However, the Marines don\\u2019t have SEAL teams, as those are part of the Navy."}   \n\nevent: delta\ndata: {"v": " It\\u2019s a bit ambiguous since \\u201cmarines seal\\u201d could refer to a lot of things. I think the best approach"}    \n\nevent: delta\ndata: {"v": " is to clarify: I\\u2019ll ask the user, \\u201cAre you"}  \n\nevent: delta\ndata: {"v": " asking about the official US Marine Corps seal or Marines\' role in SEAL teams?\\u201d This should get me"}       \n\nevent: delta\ndata: {"p": "", "o": "patch", "v": [{"p": "/message/content/thoughts/1/content", "o": "append", "v": " the info I need without overwhelming them."}, {"p": "/message/status", "o": "replace", "v": "finished_successfully"}]} \n\nevent: delta\ndata: {"o": "add", "v": {"message": {"id": "f983d25a-0f68-40ba-bbc1-df4e74388061", "author": {"role": "assistant", "name": null, "metadata": {}}, "create_time": 1754239911.407135, "update_time": null, "content": {"content_type": "code", "language": "unknown", "response_format_name": null, "text": ""}, "status": "in_progress", "end_turn": null, "weight": 1.0, "metadata": {"citations": [], "content_references": [], "reasoning_status": "is_reasoning", "request_id": "96975270082d25a4-IAD", "message_type": "next", "model_slug": "o4-mini", "default_model_slug": "o4-mini", "parent_id": "a7e474ed-4d0c-458e-8845-39f6208f6c42", "model_switcher_deny": []}, "recipient": "web.run", "channel": null}, "conversation_id": "688f93a6-a128-8330-8f